 eps on Moorlands Road (3% - 5% incline)\, followed by an arbitrary cool-dow
 n. I will work out a way to ensure we're regrouping before each rep - it'll
  probably involve a whistle. \n\nDistance: 10km-12km depending\nPace: WU/CD
  4:45 - 5:00min/km\nRoute: up and down\, probably six times\n\nPlease take 
 the appropriate low-light precautions\, but we will largely be on quiet roa
 ds. \n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/34
